<h1>Kitchen HACCP — Food Safety Guide</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Hazard Analysis and Critical Control Points, from receiving to service — one quick-glance visual for the whole team.</p>
</div>
<div class="section-card">
<p class="disclaimer">This poster is a general operational reference based on widely used HACCP principles. It does not replace formal HACCP certification, local food safety regulations, or your property's certified HACCP plan. For the detailed, fillable version with temperature tables and sign-off fields, use the full checklist linked below.</p>
</div>
